1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:03,750
(Howard:)Not until he stops humping
his way up my family tree!

2
00:00:05,985 --> 00:00:08,485
(Amy:)Sheldon, this is silly.

3
00:00:08,488 --> 00:00:10,018
(Amy:)I'm not missing another prom.

4
00:00:10,023 --> 00:00:11,223
(Amy:)I'm going upstairs now.

5
00:00:11,224 --> 00:00:12,724
(Amy:)Good-bye.

6
00:00:12,725 --> 00:00:15,725
(Sheldon:)I really did think
you looked pretty.

7
00:00:15,728 --> 00:00:17,558
(Amy:)You did?

8
00:00:17,563 --> 00:00:20,033
(Raj:)Yes.

9
00:00:20,033 --> 00:00:22,233
(Sheldon:)So much so that
I started to panic.

10
00:00:22,235 --> 00:00:24,235
(Amy:)Well, you can relax.

11
00:00:25,204 --> 00:00:27,834
(Amy:)Just because you think
I look pretty

12
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,040
(Amy:)doesn't mean we have
to spend the night together.

13
00:00:30,043 --> 00:00:33,843
(Sheldon:)Were you hoping we would
because it's prom?

14
00:00:33,846 --> 00:00:36,116
(Amy:)I'm always hoping.

15
00:00:37,417 --> 00:00:41,817
(Amy:)But tonight I just wanted
to have a nice time with you.

16
00:00:41,821 --> 00:00:44,791
(Amy:)And maybe dance
with someone who has arms.

17
00:00:46,926 --> 00:00:48,596
(Sheldon:)Thank you for understanding.

18
00:00:48,594 --> 00:00:50,894
(Amy:)Of course I understand.

19
00:00:52,999 --> 00:00:55,499
(Amy:)Sheldon,

20
00:00:55,501 --> 00:00:57,501
(Amy:)there's something else
I've been wanting to say,

21
00:00:57,503 --> 00:00:59,503
(Amy:)but before I do,
I just...

22
00:00:59,505 --> 00:01:03,245
(Amy:)I want you to know that you
don't have to say it back.

